{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"signed-in caller’s own","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendOwnVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC21resendOwnVerificationyyYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"resendOwnVerification()","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes no address. The server reads it off the caller’s own record, and this signature","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deliberately offers no way to name a different one: a parameter here would let an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authenticated session mail an arbitrary address.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)"},{"type":"text","text":" this reports the outcome, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller is signed in to the account it is asking about and none of the outcomes tells"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it anything it did not already bring with it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"returns — a token was minted and the mail "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"enqueued","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Delivery is asynchronous"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and can still fail at the provider; a queue that accepts everything in front of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider that rejects it looks exactly like this succeeding (§25.7 rule 3)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.authz","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (from "},{"code":"409","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — already verified, or an account state that must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be sent a live token."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AxiamError.network","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from ","type":"text"},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — the daily resend limit.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"§25.7 rule 2 forbids falling back to the unauthenticated endpoint on either failure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and this SDK does not: that fallback turns both back into a silent success and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restores the bug this operation exists to fix, with an extra round trip."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Refused client-side with ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"no wire call"}]},{"text":" when there is no session.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AxiamClient"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","abstract":[{"text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md).","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","title":"AxiamClient","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendOwnVerification()":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendownverification()","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/users\/me\/resend-verification"},{"text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1, §25.7) — resend the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"signed-in caller’s own"}]},{"text":" verification mail, and say what happened.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resendOwnVerification","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendOwnVerification()","title":"resendOwnVerification()"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/api\/v1\/auth\/resend-verification"},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §25.1) — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"unauthenticated","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" resend, for a caller with no session."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","title":"resendVerification(email:tenantID:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/resendverification(email:tenantid:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resendVerification"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"email"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk"}}}